raised, you would take physical damage (bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing) from an attack.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>You snap your shield in place to ward off a blow. Your shield prevents you from taking an amount of damage up to the shield's Hardness. You and the shield each take any remaining damage, possibly breaking or destroying the shield.</p>","gm":""},"level":{"value":1},"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general"],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"shield-block","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null},"onlyLevel1":false,"maxTakable":1,"subfeatures":{"proficiencies":{},"senses":{},"suppressedFeatures":[]},"location":null},"type":"feat","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.368","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.1","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8","createdTime":1791148313608,"modifiedTime":1791148313609,"lastModifiedBy":"4rkJy22gMYdqEeLw","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"4rkJy22gMYdqEeLw":3},"flags":{"pf2e":{"grantedBy":{"id":"qMqFs9rT3gjxzdgN","onDelete":"cascade"}}},"_id":"SQLg09UrB5qUSj6p"},{"folder":"dfRpdU8Efsenms12","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Raise a Shield","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a shield.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>You position your shield to protect yourself. When you have Raised a Shield, you gain its listed circumstance bonus to AC. Your shield remains raised until the start of your next turn.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"selfEffect":{"name":"Effect: Raise a Shield","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.2YgXoHvJfrDHucMr"},"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"raise-a-shield","_migra